      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<h1>FIND HMUR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.poster.avif?t=1770447658\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.webm?t=1770447658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.mp4?t=1770447658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense of Egypt: Cleopatra Mission takes you to a land where the desert wind carries the sound of war. Under the burning sun and the gaze of the gods, every stone tower and bronze weapon becomes a shield for your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/123875e6ae1275ad4bcced8855cc272a.avif?t=1770447658\" width=744 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across sixty missions you will fight on shifting dunes, riverbanks, and sacred temples. Sixteen enemy types march against you: infantry charging the gates, war machines grinding forward, raiders from the skies and ships rising from the Nile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have six kinds of towers to build and upgrade, each with its own strength. Five special mechanisms can twist their power even further, turning a simple defense into a deadly machine. And when the horde presses too close, you can intervene yourself: call down lightning, hurl grenades, or scatter deadly traps to break the assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a choice: do you play carefully, testing every path, or strike boldly and risk it all? The world of Ancient Egypt gives familiar tower defense mechanics a vivid tone—sun, sand, stone, and steel.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense of Egypt: Cleopatra Mission takes you to a land where the desert wind carries the sound of war. Under the burning sun and the gaze of the gods, every stone tower and bronze weapon becomes a shield for your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/123875e6ae1275ad4bcced8855cc272a.avif?t=1770447658\" width=744 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across sixty missions you will fight on shifting dunes, riverbanks, and sacred temples. Sixteen enemy types march against you: infantry charging the gates, war machines grinding forward, raiders from the skies and ships rising from the Nile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have six kinds of towers to build and upgrade, each with its own strength. Five special mechanisms can twist their power even further, turning a simple defense into a deadly machine. And when the horde presses too close, you can intervene yourself: call down lightning, hurl grenades, or scatter deadly traps to break the assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a choice: do you play carefully, testing every path, or strike boldly and risk it all? The world of Ancient Egypt gives familiar tower defense mechanics a vivid tone—sun, sand, stone, and steel.</p>",
